hypothesis: The distill_weight sweep was MONOTONE across 0.5, 1.0, 1.5 and 2.0 and
  never turned over, but it was stopped at 2.0 on an argument that a higher floor
  should not help -- an argument we never tested, in the same class of untested claim
  that v038 and v041 are designed to correct. A monotone response with the optimum
  beyond the tested range is the textbook case for extending the range. v039 also
  showed the student has OVERTAKEN its own teacher, which raises the case for trusting
  the teacher more.
